   "value": "<p><em>Starlight Symphony — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, as a full turn action for 8 cursed energy you can summon Inari in an unoccupied space within 10 feet. Inari disappears after 1 minute and uses your proficiency bonus. You can command Inari and your fox shikigami as an action on your turn. Inari is considered one of your fox shikigami for any of your features other than <em>Living Fog</em>.</p>",
